abstract: >-
  Spyder Network is an independent blockchain ecosystem currently under
  research and development. This publication introduces SpyderChain,
  SpyderCoin (SPD), Spyder Wallet, preliminary tokenomics, network security
  considerations, and the long-term development roadmap for 2026–2032. All
  figures and specifications are preliminary. This publication does not
  announce a token sale, public mainnet launch, investment offering, or
  guaranteed financial returns.
